Package: postgresql-18-pg-vault-tde-aesni
Architecture: amd64
Depends: postgresql-18-pg-vault-tde (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: pg_vault_tde AES-NI optimized build for x86_64
 Recompiled with -maes -mpclmul -mvaes flags for Intel/AMD CPUs with
 AES New Instructions (AES-NI) hardware support.
 .
 This package provides maximum encryption throughput on modern x86_64 CPUs.
 CPU requirement: Intel Core 2010+, AMD Zen+ (2017+) or later.
